changelog	Format: [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), versioning: [SemVer](https://semver.org/). The file format has its own version (`%KAPU 1.3`, see `SPEC-KAPU.md`); the tools below are versioned separately. Specification v1.3: a file whose `#VEC` holds 4- or 8-bit integers is format 1.3, every other file stays 1.2. Plan v3 (D168-D172): the bundled vector model is now `multilingual-e5-small`, a contextual encoder run in plain Rust (`bench/RESULTS.md` chapter 13, `bench/results/2026-10-28-plan-v3.json`, the results page with a new section and its PDFs). There is no 0.4.0. - The bundled vector model is `multilingual-e5-small` in its int8 form (`models/multilingual-e5-small-q8`, 135 MB) instead of `potion-multilingual-128M` (D172). The release workflow downloads the int8	kapu, file, py, tools, results, bench results, room, mdn
